    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-17T00:36:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Many public libraries lend more than books: some offer tools, musical instruments or museum passes. Check your local catalogue before buying something you’ll use only occasionally.</div>
    </content>
