  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#9bb9404fba402f23b7efb611479c8fb40d48ec735c2786bc351395140e6c6238</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-17T00:36:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Crows can recognise human faces and remember people who have treated them as threats, a striking example of how wildlife learns and adapts.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#ae2016b21036adf6d9f756335a3abf063bb5840d3d2d5923a309e77fb1fa5379</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-17T00:36:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Spend three minutes clearing one small patch of a shared surface at home, returning stray items to their usual places and wiping away any crumbs.</div>
    </content>
